k\" data-tab=\"characters\">Characters</a>\n            <a href=\"#pronunciations\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"pronunciations\">Pronunciations</a>\n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"overview\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n            <header>\n                <h1>Masque of the Red Death - Poe</h1>\n                <p class=\"meta\">\n                    by Edgar Allan Poe &middot; \n                    Narrator's Guide &middot; Generated 2026-01-19 09:28\n                </p>\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\n                    Analyzed with qwen3:30b-instruct\n                     in \n                    8m 27s\n                </p>\n                \n\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Started:</strong> Jan 19, 2026 at 9:19 AM &middot;\n                    <strong>Ended:</strong> Jan 19, 2026 at 9:27 AM\n                </p>\n                \n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">2,449</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Words</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">0h 16m</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Est. Duration</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">1</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Chapters</div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">0</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Main Characters</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">73</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Pronunciation Notes</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📚 Book Structure</h2>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;\">This book contains 1 chapters. Chapters are numbered sequentially.</p>\n                \n                \n            </section>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📖 Plot Summary</h2>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The story begins in the midst of a terrifying pandemic known as the 'Red Death,' a merciless plague that spreads rapidly, causing victims to bleed from their pores and die within minutes. In response to the chaos, Prince Prospero, a man of immense wealth and arrogance, retreats with a thousand courtiers into a secluded, heavily fortified abbey, sealing themselves off from the outside world in a desperate bid to escape death. Within the abbey’s opulent halls, seven uniquely themed rooms—each adorned with stained-glass windows matching their color and decor—host a lavish masked ball, a grotesque celebration of life amid the looming specter of death. The atmosphere is one of frenzied indulgence, illuminated only by flickering firelight from braziers outside, casting eerie shadows across the gilded walls.\n\nAs the revelry reaches its peak, a mysterious figure appears, dressed as the Red Death itself—clad in a blood-smeared shroud and wearing a mask that mimics the disease’s gruesome symptoms. The figure moves silently through the seven rooms, a chilling presence that disrupts the illusion of safety. Prince Prospero, enraged by what he perceives as a blasphemous mockery of his sanctuary, draws a dagger and pursues the intruder through each chamber, driven by fury and a need to assert control. The chase becomes a macabre dance through the symbolic progression of life and death, culminating in the final, black chamber—the room of death—where the figure turns to face him.\n\nIn the black chamber, the prince collapses, dead, revealing the horrifying truth: the figure was not a man, but the Red Death itself, having infiltrated the abbey under the guise of a masquerade. The revelers, now realizing the futility of their isolation, rush forward only to find the mask and robes empty. As the ebony clock in the chamber strikes midnight, its chime echoing through the halls, the final moment of reckoning arrives—each guest dies in turn, one by one, until the abbey is consumed by darkness. The story ends with the complete annihilation of the elite who sought to defy mortality through wealth and seclusion, underscoring the inevitability of death and the fragility of human illusions.\n\nThe narrative centers on Prince Prospero’s hubris and his failed attempt to escape fate through isolation and extravagance. His relationship with the courtiers is one of dominance and dependency, built on privilege rather than connection. The mysterious figure, never fully explained, serves as a manifestation of the plague and the inescapable nature of death, turning the ball into a tragic allegory. The turning point occurs when the prince’s pursuit ends in his own demise, revealing that the Red Death was never an outsider but an inevitable presence that had always been within their midst. The climax is not a battle, but a revelation—death is not defeated by walls or masks, but is the ultimate equalizer.\n\nThe story’s conclusion is not one of redemption or survival, but of total collapse. The abbey, once a symbol of human defiance, becomes a tomb, its final silence a testament to the futility of resisting fate. The revelers’ indulgence and denial of mortality are rendered meaningless in the face of the Red Death’s arrival. The narrative’s power lies in its chilling inevitability and the tragic irony of those who believed themselves safe. The final image—the stopped clock and the darkness—serves as a haunting reminder that no sanctuary, no matter how elaborate, can shield one from the universal truth of death.</div>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Themes:</strong> identity, ambition, loss\n                </p>\n                \n            </section>\n            \n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>🤖 Analysis Models</h2>\n                <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Phase</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Model</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Provider</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">Chapter Detection</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">qwen3:30b-instruct</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">ollama</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">Character Extraction</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">qwen3-next:80b-a3b-instruct-q8_0</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">ollama</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\